+    'the order the Proof\'s Run greps for (KATA_SERVER, KATA_AUTH_TOKEN, KATA_AUTHOR, ' +
+    'KATA_REF, attention-hook start, attention-hook end). The bullet reads:\n' + bullet)
+  assert.ok(bullet.includes(KATA_SERVER),
