-# (d) (e) (f) [M4] — the file-count threshold this block pinned is retired by  #
-# #756 Task 2. Its three checkouts are rewritten under `#756 Task 2` below,    #
-# as legs (f) of that task: nine files, nine with one declared, and eight.     #
